*Considering city classification**\n\nI’m pondering whether something counts as a \"city.\" A commune might fit under that classification. I definitely need to keep an eye on the weather-based tool results for context as I think about this. I want to make my answer concise, but I must tread carefully to avoid making any inaccurate claims. The candidate condition seems related to some specific math — it's looking like p≡5 mod6. I’ll make sure everything aligns correctly."}]},{"id":"rs_0a6f517af0616dc3016ac2717e49388190ba882e7bdec1c968","type":"reasoning","content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABqwnF_Wwt9dMxtl7KYHSb0rW6gSHuPYNxURJCMnT9TH2McGGe-96iJMjBNKyM10lU9bytvRLuGx6U1vr_BERY2OZ3FkmEOK4T_HLopowazkh_PbagJmnlRDC088X2nvb7F5yJtRqpO---vs9royKZTMNf-6HQN3Hh2qj9aefpzAHSVPrIvL0iZRqibO_Qso0FcLivbR3_Mv-PwTtYSp-k6_s-z3mxmrAW3t_fytWMqZX5BVoGBpl65VwhAtK9vDTE-VYTfwaxbu9_hlAx4K4Jd6vGiU2IppYZcNMf5aPbMsnjQCSG62Q2Bfn99GXAHe81LBgUDJ-LmbKdUafBtbLwm0D3Y9UrQ7jZ9IMi5k_EccIuDBBO41h47FKq1rJMQv2XCOMAeoczAQ-h1ul4hA7gN6wKVmK29SaswbrblFWpp5AOupCbJ-jCpWQQQHGqokFGVHWQ7jvbg0m7J3oiyqoDRkLzfq25hYnbJugUvv2dvWNcwZ55AbwE80ZtpAqGszmGuo8_trPLS2n6dYvkO8CCe1oIcw39kAPOza-ISl0L67I8Oyb6WAzx7Lf6h0inTj5M-7T2xLYzWhMA_vay1bt1iB6Zx8ue91oIMG22khrAc9SUvLL7ULS39Ul3bKyOTJczC3ecqlceKWjwTOTRybHuOZw56Q9vNxyUr4QJmRxR0u7JLKmrXy1MzmKvwaIDwp9qtYOpIF4zLnh8gMFdcVMeSQ75ezvHvp0P3BmUZAEusVovcK7veAtk5RKBsv03y4GPjYc5SyZc3mC_IwVegZjTpCq31LH3IL3nijAtFdlvvrCu-Vqih7L6G4MFwswc24wbaL4Er2MAcHMroiOeog4P0wJMdG_f8hbbUo7ZR-bIoTBOGCW8L02KB5grfzTbSFQ-QmInWZSr0qIzdnAuvlDZXbkzaeaz55wUWN80xA2-lAcSWpWLnRBNvHhGOhNT6_rgMoK29Y2R-8OZ6vOcUTHOfrEp27dI_0a1ZUlECwtU5TX_shoIoZeqMH9ARpx1ZcUPDgjOYlxtQLWvf2x_IlanlX6d_Wx8WlG3ZOSDnmYBG6Fx-WC3tbih2LzvKQmwvqK6ZbCPAt2O7ffan7VqMZSIVKyu2R0TuoryUNv-ftIrNzElNnRayLoJk8soyy-GORXdgZtGiYvvroxzVp4EF_Wy8jbmF2evVqRnWXt7iDBsFjPiMsLSYgjdhpNjOc1Ez_WmDd_07J0IieC6qvicQOhOyo_eTdztulq7eKOMMlTivyamADp8zriiyj-5QxP-1KOM9OTBfaLiC1OZlUyyH--C8DoC5rnSWgK8WadSyXrdzz7o-oqrbwt6iOdfUz2AeVpUvqwsQmeTRaThB9fiQXyTiH-_0iMEAAPzUhWwzm5Tg5MD2NW5nPa-yDhYSZ1vqTime4quSxIyRDy_jxSZNlu59hKdfVwVkq-pMDWTSeA_ghX__bQ2s-CXaOefJS9FNVrgyfCj98HX1sgB_AVt5WOfL3ZLY2fk2tVfM1OTIHmc1v7Rm_Yz-7Ue13p9Q-tCSqcCzvwumoKII0e2dz-PtArMRV4p2gqLgWHvBXdR-f0_9orpDm4Q2YxxGn5Bzi2eXXNfuyJXJPJeiK8bPCXaZgrqrsz0_QA==","summary":[{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Clarifying mathematical concepts**\n\nI can't have p ≡ 1 mod 3 since p + 2 is divisible by 3. So, p ≡ 5 mod 6, and I need to consider candidates in increments of 6. To prove the primality of three, I should use divisibility tests up to 33. Trial division might be mentioned here, and then I’ll output the weather. It seems I need to reference \"Y, France\" for the weather result. That sounds good!"}]},{"id":"msg_0a6f517af0616dc3016ac2717f8ab881908c5648fe66a4975f","type":"message","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"output_text","annotations":[],"logprobs":[],"text":"Since \\(p>1000\\) is an odd prime, and \\(p+2\\) cannot be divisible by 3, \\(p\\equiv5\\pmod 6\\). The candidates therefore go \\(1001,1007,\\ldots\\), in steps of 6.\n\nBefore 1091, each candidate fails: \\(1001=7\\cdot143\\), \\(1007=19\\cdot53\\); for 1013, 1019, 1043, 1049, and 1079, respectively, \\(p+2\\) or \\(p+6\\) is divisible by 5; \\(1025\\) and \\(1055\\) are divisible by 5; \\(1031+6=1037=17\\cdot61\\); \\(1061+6=1067=11\\cdot97\\); and \\(1073=29\\cdot37\\).\n\nFor \\(p=1091\\), all three numbers \\(1091,1093,1097\\) have no prime divisor at most 33 (their square roots are below 34), so all are prime. Thus the smallest such prime is **1091**.\n\nIts last digit is 1, so I checked weather for **Y, France**, a one-letter commune: **14°C, rain**."}],"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0.0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":"t2","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"high","mode":"standard","summary":"detailed"},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","store":false,"temperature":1.0,"text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"tools":[{"type":"function","description":"Get weather","name":"weather","output_schema":null,"parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"city":{"type":"string"}},"required":["city"],"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":0.98,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":1316,"input_tokens_details":{"cache_write_tokens":1313,"cached_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1412,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":1126},"total_tokens":2728},"user":null,"metadata":{}},"sequence_number":289}

